sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client(业务侧)
    participant F as Fastify Server
    participant AK as ApiKeyAuth 中间件
    participant RL as RateLimiter
    participant RE as RouterEngine
    participant CB as CircuitBreaker
    participant PR as ProviderRegistry
    participant UP as 上游 Provider
    participant CC as CostCalculator
    participant UL as UsageLogRepository
    participant EB as EventBus

    C->>F: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer sk-...
    F->>AK: 校验 API Key
    AK->>AK: SHA-256+salt 哈希明文 Key
    AK->>UL: findByHash(hash)
    UL-->>AK: ApiKeyEntity(tenant, whitelist, 状态)
    alt Key 无效/吊销/过期/模型不在白名单
        AK-->>F: AppError(UAG-2001/2002/2003)
        F-->>C: 401/403 OpenAI 兼容错误
    end
    AK-->>F: RequestContext(tenant, key, virtualModel)
    F->>RL: acquire(global + perKey + concurrency)
    alt 限流超限
        RL-->>F: denied(retryAfterMs)
        F-->>C: 429 + Retry-After
        F->>EB: publish(rate_limited)
    end
    F->>RE: resolve(ctx)  ← 虚拟模型别名解析 + 策略选择
    RE-->>F: RouteDecision(provider='moonshot-prod', model='kimi-k3', candidates=[...])
    loop 候选故障转移（最多 len(candidates) 次）
        F->>CB: allow(providerKey)
        alt 熔断 OPEN
            CB-->>F: open(retryAfterMs)
            F->>RE: nextCandidate(prev, reason='circuit_open')
        else 熔断 CLOSED/HALF_OPEN
            CB-->>F: allowed
            F->>PR: get('moonshot-prod')
            PR-->>F: ProviderAdapter
            F->>UP: 适配器转换后的上游请求
            alt 上游成功
                UP-->>F: 响应(含 usage)
                F->>CB: recordSuccess(providerKey)
                F->>CC: calculate(usage, pricingTable)
                CC-->>F: cost(微元)
                F->>UL: insert(usageLog)
                F->>UL: upsert(dailyStats)
                F->>EB: publish(usage_recorded)
                F-->>C: 200 OpenAI 兼容响应
            else 上游失败/超时
                UP-->>F: 5xx/超时/网络错误
                F->>CB: recordFailure(providerKey, error)
                F->>RE: nextCandidate(prev, reason='upstream_error')
            end
        end
    end
    Note over F,C: 所有候选均失败 → 502 + UAG-4002
